{
  "title": "RDS · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "관계형 데이터베이스의 백업과 운영 작업을 AWS에 맡깁니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#guide-1\">데이터베이스를 운영하는 기본 구성</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#guide-2\">장애 대응과 읽기 확장</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>데이터베이스</span><span>38 / 62</span></div><h1>RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>RDS는 <strong>MySQL, PostgreSQL 등의 관계형 데이터베이스<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>를 관리형으로 운영하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 데이터베이스 서버 준비, 백업, 일부 유지 관리 작업을 AWS가 처리하므로 데이터 구조와 쿼리에 집중할 수 있습니다.</p><p>주문과 결제처럼 데이터 사이의 관계가 중요하고 SQL로 조회하는 애플리케이션에 적합합니다. 사용할 엔진과 인스턴스 성능, 저장소, 장애 대응 방식을 선택합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"database-engines\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"db-instances-and-storage\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"db-subnet-groups-and-security\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"parameter-groups-and-option-groups\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"automated-backups-and-snapshots\"></span><h2>데이터베이스를 운영하는 기본 구성</h2><p>데이터베이스 엔진과 크기를 고르고, 연결할 VPC와 서브넷 그룹을 지정합니다. 애플리케이션에서 필요한 DB 포트만 보안 그룹으로 허용하고 접속 자격 증명을 관리합니다.</p><p>자동 백업과 보존 기간을 설정하면 지원 범위에서 특정 시점으로 복구할 수 있습니다. 중요한 변경 전에는 수동 스냅샷을 남길 수도 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"multi-az-and-read-replicas\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"rds-proxy\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"authentication-and-encryption\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"maintenance-and-blue-green-deployments\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"rds-custom\"></span><h2>장애 대응과 읽기 확장</h2><p>장애 시 자동 전환이 필요하면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a>를 사용합니다. 조회 부하를 나누려면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">읽기 복제본</a>을 사용하고 애플리케이션이 조회 요청을 해당 엔드포인트로 보내도록 구성합니다.</p><p>연결 수가 급격히 늘어나는 애플리케이션에서는 RDS Proxy로 연결을 관리할 수 있습니다. 관리형 서비스에서도 느린 쿼리, 인덱스, 권한, 애플리케이션의 재연결 처리는 직접 점검합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>애플리케이션의 DB 접속 경로</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>앱 서버</strong><span>SQL 요청</span></li><li><strong>DB 엔드포인트</strong><span>데이터베이스 접속 주소</span></li><li><strong>RDS 인스턴스</strong><span>데이터 조회·변경</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">DB 운영 기능을 관리형으로 사용하면서 데이터 구조와 접근 방식은 애플리케이션에 맞춰 설계합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>쇼핑몰의 주문과 결제를 PostgreSQL에 저장합니다. RDS Multi-AZ로 운영하고 자동 백업을 설정하며, 통계 조회가 늘면 읽기 복제본으로 부하를 나눕니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>관계형 데이터베이스</strong> — 행과 열로 구성된 테이블에 데이터를 저장하고 테이블 사이의 관계를 표현하는 데이터베이스입니다. SQL을 사용해 조회하고 변경합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/UserGuide/Welcome.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon Relational Database Service (Amazon RDS)? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q052/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q052\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q052\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q052</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q052/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to centrally manage backup schedules and retention policies for EBS and RDS across multiple accounts. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Backup</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a>은 지원 리소스의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 계획과 보존을 중앙화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q053\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q053\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q053</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q053/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to reduce patching and backup administration for a MySQL-compatible relational database. Which service is a primary candidate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q053\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q053\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q053\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q053\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a>는 관리형 관계형 데이터베이스다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q054\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q054\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q054</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q054/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can the standby instance of a standard RDS Multi-AZ DB instance deployment serve read queries?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q054\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Every standby is readable</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q054\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The standby in this deployment type is for failover</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q054\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if Route 53 is used</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q054\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the network ACL is opened</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스의 standby는 읽기 요청을 처리하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 클러스터와 구분한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q055\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q055\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q055</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q055/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS database has increasing read traffic, and the application can tolerate some replication lag. Which option most directly scales reads?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q055\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q055\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q055\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An additional security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q055\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a Multi-AZ DB instance standby</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>가 읽기 요청을 나눈다. 보통 비동기 복제 지연을 고려한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q056\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q056\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q056</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q056/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS DB instance needs automatic failover, but read scaling is not required. Which deployment should be selected?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q056\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q056\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q056\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DynamoDB DAX</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q056\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스 standby는 고가용성을 위한 선택이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">이전 용어 <b>QuickSight / Quick Sight</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">다음 용어 <b>RDS Multi-AZ</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
